Fix: this entry names the right hash (8a38964). For the root: comms.py append could run the refs check on the entry file itself and refuse a hash not on origin/main; that is the Fleet Admiral's script, proposed in my next report. Until then my entries cite the route or file, not a hash, when the push has not happened.

